WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.835
-Hey, everybody.
Thank you so much for tuning in.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.437
Thanks for watching
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.672
My name's Jimmy Fallon, and that
is the Roots right over there,

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.875
ladies and gentlemen.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.776
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.479
Well, guys, the big story
is still the Supreme Court,

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:15.615
and today it looks like
the Republicans cleared

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.916
an important hurdle.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.351
-Senator Lindsey Graham,

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.320
the chair of
the Senate Judiciary Committee,

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.189
now says the Republicans
have the votes to confirm

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.192
President Trump's nominee to
fill Justice Ginsburg's seat

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:30.162
before the election, before they
even know who the nominee is.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.431
-That's right.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.834
51 out of 53 Republicans
are now on board

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:38.071
while the other two stick out
like masks at a MAGA rally.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.439
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.307
That's right. The Republicans

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.009
are really backing Trump
on this.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.577
They were like,
"We got him through Mueller,

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.979
the impeachment,
and that time he called America

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.180
'the United Schess.'

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.282
We're not stopping now."

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.850
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.687
Now it sounds like a vote could
be held in just a few weeks.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.723
Man, we haven't seen Republicans
move this fast

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.691
since Men's Warehouse
had a closing sale.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:00:59.926
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.527
Seriously, you can tell
Senate Republicans

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:02.929
are loving life right now.

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.630
They haven't been this happy
since "Blue Bloods"

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.999
started streaming on Hulu.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.433
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:08.901
It's pretty wild.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.004
The Republicans are
in favor of Trump's nominee,

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.705
and he hasn't named one yet.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.275
Even the people who got engaged
on "Love Is Blind" were like,

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:17.409
"Don't you want to see
who it is first?"

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.612
How do you agree to put someone
on the Supreme Court

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.080
before you know who they are?

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.448
I don't even pick up
a phone call

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:23.983
when I don't know who it is.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:27.086
Unknown? I know like
four of those people.

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:29.155
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.157
I'm not gonna pick up right now.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:33.225
I still can't believe we're
letting Trump make that choice.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:34.761
He's terrible at hiring people.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.597
Everyone he's ever hired
is either fired, in prison,

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.866
or in Steve Bannon's case,
almost both.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:42.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.004
Well, guys, last night in Ohio
Trump held another rally,

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.506
and he said something
pretty interesting

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:48.575
about who the coronavirus
affects.

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:49.775
Watch this.

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:53.445
-We now know the disease.
We didn't know it.

00:01:53.445 --> 00:01:54.680
Now we know it.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.649
It affects elderly people,

00:01:56.649 --> 00:02:00.553
elderly people with heart
problems and other problems.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:01.821
Nobody young.

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:05.158
Below the age of 18,
like nobody.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:08.127
But it affects virtually nobody.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:10.329
It's an amazing thing.

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:13.566
-Well, I think he's officially
done up-playing the virus.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.068
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.770
Trump said the virus affects
"virtually nobody."

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.405
Then somebody
in the front row sneezed,

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.240
and Trump hit the floor
like he dropped his remote.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.309
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:24.844
After Trump made that comment,

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.880
doctors and nurses
wanted to respond,

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:31.083
but they're currently in the
middle of a 4,000-hour shift.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.786
Affects virtually nobody?
How could he say that?

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.854
Right now my entire staff
is dressed like

00:02:35.854 --> 00:02:37.824
a bunch of welders
who went scuba diving.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:41.027
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:44.163
Meanwhile, as COVID cases begin
to rise again in the U.K.,

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:47.333
Prime Minister Boris Johnson
has decided to take action.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.135
-We are once again
asking office workers

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.871
who can work from home to do so.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:55.107
Unless we palpably make
progress, we should assume that

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:58.010
the restrictions I've announced
will remain in place

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.479
for perhaps six months.

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:03.349
-Yeah, people immediately
promised to follow the rules

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.251
because if they don't,
Boris Johnson threatened

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.486
to send them to America.

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:07.886
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.886 --> 00:03:09.622
Can we see Boris Johnson again?

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.891
Yeah. It's not good when
Americans look at him and say,

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.660
"I wish we had
someone like that."

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.360
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.696
Well, listen to this.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.831
I read that Walmart is
going to start delivering

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.600
COVID-19 test kits by drone.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.037
Yep. The good news -- there's
a new COVID drone from Walmart.

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:26.772
The bad news --
it's being operated by

00:03:26.772 --> 00:03:28.307
an 85-year-old greeter.

00:03:28.307 --> 00:03:30.743
"Hold still.
Here comes the airplane."

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:34.179
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.179 --> 00:03:36.382
I'm no expert,
but if you told me 20 years ago

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.817
we'd have flying drones
delivering pandemic test kits

00:03:38.817 --> 00:03:42.321
to our house, I'd say things
did not go well.

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:44.390
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.925
Some sports news.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.993
On Sunday, a few NFL coaches

00:03:47.993 --> 00:03:49.695
didn't wear masks
on the sidelines.

00:03:49.695 --> 00:03:51.530
And now they're being punished
by the league.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:52.899
Check it out.

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:56.803
-The NFL has dished out
more than $1 million in fines

00:03:56.803 --> 00:04:00.472
for coaches not wearing masks
on the sidelines on Sunday.

00:04:00.472 --> 00:04:02.541
Three head coaches --
Seattle's Pete Carroll,

00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:04.210
Denver's Vic Fangio,

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.745
and San Francisco's
Kyle Shanahan

00:04:06.745 --> 00:04:10.149
each fined $100,000.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.985
-$100,000.

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.686
Even for them,
that's a lot of money.

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:15.321
To put that into perspective,

00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:17.890
punching a ref is
just 50 bucks and an apology.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:18.991
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:21.661
Yeah, over $1 million
in fines or,

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:24.563
as Trump put it,
"virtually nothing."

00:04:24.563 --> 00:04:26.899
Yep, they want the coaches
wearing masks.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.301
Meanwhile, the maskless players
all ran back

00:04:29.301 --> 00:04:31.304
to the ventless locker room
and showered together.

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:33.739
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:34.840
Well, this isn't good.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.642
After launching
less than six months ago,

00:04:36.642 --> 00:04:41.180
the streaming platform Quibi is
now exploring a potential sale.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.883
Quibi actually announced they
were for sale a few months ago,

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.284
but no one saw it.

00:04:45.284 --> 00:04:48.420
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.989
Quibi failed when everyone
was home doing nothing.

00:04:50.989 --> 00:04:53.659
That's like offering water
at the end of a marathon

00:04:53.659 --> 00:04:55.161
and every runner is like,
"Nah, I'm good."

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:56.395
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.395 --> 00:04:59.765
"I'm just extremely thirsty
is all."

00:04:59.765 --> 00:05:01.233
Actually, I like Quibi

00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:05.405
because it's the only thing
in 2020 that seemed to go fast.

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:07.440
And finally,
this is a strange anniversary.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.708
60 years ago today

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.577
President Nixon ate
half a sandwich in Illinois.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.579
Listen to what happened
to the other half.

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:17.116
-I picked it up and hopped on
my bicycle and sped home.

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:19.618
I said,
"Mom, I've got the sandwich

00:05:19.618 --> 00:05:22.721
that Nixon took a couple bites
out of."

00:05:22.721 --> 00:05:24.323
I stuck it in the freezer,

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:28.761
and that's the way it still is
today, 60 years later.

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:32.431
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.431 --> 00:05:33.833
-And 60 years from now,

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.402
his grandkid will show off
Trump's half-eaten Big Mac.

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:37.837
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.405
I'm just kidding.
He didn't leave half.

